  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊......！小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "唔！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱，抱歉，我不是有意撞過來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我沒事的。你很有禮貌呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘿嘿......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咦，姐姐你在這裡做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡還在下雨呢，為什麼不躲一躲？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "啊......嗯......我只是......出來走走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "你是在找人幫忙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊！姐姐是怎麼知道的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不能告訴你！這可是姐姐的秘密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔唔......不管了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姐姐，能不能請你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好像......不太行。姐姐，你的個子，太小了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "可不能這麼說別人！你明明比我矮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哇哇！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那，那我們試試吧......嗯......能不能幫我抬一下那塊板子？一起來吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那個鐵架下面，有台留聲機，我想拿回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "1......2......3！嘿！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "成功了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哇，姐姐力氣還蠻大的呢！謝謝姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "可是......這個留聲機......還是壞了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒關係！因為它最開始就是壞的呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "總有一天可以修好的。我給大家收集了不少唱片，雖然從來都沒聽過——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "————但總有一天，我會放給大家聽的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......如此輕鬆的說著這些艱難的話......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......我到底是為了什麼......又能做什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姐姐不怕我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......怕什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我可是感染者哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "哈哈......我也是呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "什麼！太可惜了，姐姐長得這麼可愛，居然是感染者......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "感染者不是什麼問題。無論是健康人還是感染者——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "你如果是個好孩子，就一直是個好孩子哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉——？我聽不懂呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（咕嚕......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......餓了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......給你，我只帶了這些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "太好了！謝謝你，兔姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過你.....為什麼來這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "因為......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#10",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "因為我答應過一個人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孩童",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "姐姐再見！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "好的，再見！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "就連那樣的孩子，最後，最後也只會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "被剝奪了身份的人。感染者。你們早已不是人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我能做什麼呢，我又能，再多做些什麼呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "為什麼......我不能保護大家呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你不能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "饑荒......迫害......死亡......\n感染者終究只有這樣的結局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不是這樣的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "只要羅德島還在為了感染者....."
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你只是少數幸運兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不，所有人都聚在一起，向著共同的目標，不斷地努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這片大地已經麻木。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "還沒有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "感染者絕不能就此陷入絕望......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你。\n被憤怒吞噬吧。\n只有———————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不......我不會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我答應過......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我答應過她——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "那是......?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "一個姐姐和我說過，這個布偶，只有親手做的才有用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "所以所以，這個送給你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "另一個少女的聲音",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——————。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "剛才那個聲音是 ......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "那個背影————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "是陳小姐？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——————。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小女孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "————————————。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
